{"seq":2,"slug":"liquid-biopsy-ctdna","title":"博士转化医学 — 液体活检与循环肿瘤 DNA","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/biomarker-discovery/liquid-biopsy-ctdna","wordCount":1932,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士转化医学-液体活检与循环肿瘤-dna\">博士转化医学 — 液体活检与循环肿瘤 DNA</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>液体活检（Liquid Biopsy）通过分析血液或其他体液中的肿瘤衍生分子来获取肿瘤信息，无需侵入性组织活检。作为非侵入性的&quot;实时窗口&quot;，液体活检可以动态追踪肿瘤演化、监测治疗反应和检测微小残留病灶（MRD），正在重塑肿瘤精准诊断的技术格局。</p>\n<p>液体活检的主要分析物：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分析物</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>信息类型</th>\n<th>技术平台</th>\n<th>成熟度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ctDNA</td>\n<td>肿瘤细胞凋亡/坏死释放</td>\n<td>突变、甲基化、拷贝数</td>\n<td>NGS, ddPCR</td>\n<td>高（已有商业检测）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CTC</td>\n<td>血液循环中的完整肿瘤细胞</td>\n<td>形态学、蛋白表达、单细胞基因组</td>\n<td>CellSearch, 微流控</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外泌体/EVs</td>\n<td>细胞主动分泌</td>\n<td>RNA、蛋白、脂质</td>\n<td>超速离心、SEC</td>\n<td>早期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cfRNA</td>\n<td>细胞释放的游离 RNA</td>\n<td>基因表达、融合转录本</td>\n<td>RNA-seq</td>\n<td>早期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肿瘤相关血小板</td>\n<td>血小板吸收肿瘤 RNA</td>\n<td>RNA 谱</td>\n<td>RNA-seq</td>\n<td>研究阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ctDNA 是目前临床应用最成熟的液体活检分析物。其在血浆 cfDNA 中的比例（变异等位基因频率, VAF）可从 &lt;0.01% 到 &gt;50%，取决于肿瘤分期、负荷和血管化程度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[肿瘤组织] --&gt;|凋亡/坏死| B[ctDNA&lt;br/&gt;游离 DNA 片段]&#10;    A --&gt;|侵袭| C[CTC&lt;br/&gt;循环肿瘤细胞]&#10;    A --&gt;|主动分泌| D[外泌体&lt;br/&gt;EVs]&#10;    B --&gt; E[血浆分离]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[液体活检分析]&#10;    F --&gt; G[突变检测]&#10;    F --&gt; H[MRD 监测]&#10;    F --&gt; I[早期筛查]\">graph LR\n    A[肿瘤组织] --&gt;|凋亡/坏死| B[ctDNA&lt;br/&gt;游离 DNA 片段]\n    A --&gt;|侵袭| C[CTC&lt;br/&gt;循环肿瘤细胞]\n    A --&gt;|主动分泌| D[外泌体&lt;br/&gt;EVs]\n    B --&gt; E[血浆分离]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[液体活检分析]\n    F --&gt; G[突变检测]\n    F --&gt; H[MRD 监测]\n    F --&gt; I[早期筛查]</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"ctdna-检测技术\">ctDNA 检测技术</h3><p>ctDNA 检测技术按灵敏度和通量可分为两大类：</p>\n<p><strong>靶向检测（高灵敏度，有限位点）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>灵敏度（LOD）</th>\n<th>位点数</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ddPCR</td>\n<td>0.01% VAF</td>\n<td>1-5</td>\n<td>已知突变监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BEAMing</td>\n<td>0.01% VAF</td>\n<td>1-5</td>\n<td>已知突变定量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CAPP-Seq</td>\n<td>0.004% VAF</td>\n<td>数百</td>\n<td>Panel 检测+MRD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SafeSeqS</td>\n<td>0.01% VAF</td>\n<td>数十</td>\n<td>去重后超高灵敏度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>非靶向检测（广覆盖，灵敏度中等）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>灵敏度</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>浅全基因组测序（sWGS）</td>\n<td>~5% VAF</td>\n<td>全基因组 CNA</td>\n<td>拷贝数变异谱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全外显子测序（cfWES）</td>\n<td>~1% VAF</td>\n<td>全外显子</td>\n<td>全面突变谱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cfDNA 甲基化测序</td>\n<td>~0.1%</td>\n<td>全基因组 CpG</td>\n<td>组织溯源/早筛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>片段组学（Fragmentomics）</td>\n<td>~1%</td>\n<td>片段大小/末端</td>\n<td>非突变信号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>技术核心挑战</strong>——克隆性造血（Clonal Hematopoiesis of Indeterminate Potential, CHIP）：随年龄增长，造血干细胞积累体细胞突变（如 DNMT3A, TET2, ASXL1），这些非肿瘤突变会在 cfDNA 中被检出，导致假阳性。解决方案包括匹配白细胞基因组过滤和 CHIP 相关突变的系统排除。</p>\n<h3 id=\"临床应用-mrd-监测\">临床应用：MRD 监测</h3><p>微小残留病灶（MRD）检测是 ctDNA 最具转化价值的应用之一。在肿瘤切除或根治性治疗后，ctDNA 的持续存在（MRD 阳性）强烈预测复发风险。</p>\n<p><strong>MRD 检测策略</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>肿瘤知情（Tumor-informed）</strong>：先对原发肿瘤进行 WES，识别患者特异的突变谱（通常 16-50 个突变），再在术后血浆中靶向检测这些位点。代表技术：Signatera（Natera）, RaDaR（Inivata）</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MRD 阳性</mtext><mo>:</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>突变</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> 被检出</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MRD 阳性}: \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\mathbb{1}[\\text{突变}_i \\text{ 被检出}] \\geq k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MRD </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">阳性</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">突变</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">被检出</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是追踪的突变数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是判定阳性的阈值（通常 ≥2 个突变）。</p>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li><strong>肿瘤不知情（Tumor-agnostic）</strong>：使用预设的基因 Panel 或甲基化特征检测 ctDNA，无需原发肿瘤信息。代表技术：Guardant Reveal, GRAIL Galleri</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>灵敏度</th>\n<th>特异度</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>肿瘤知情</td>\n<td>极高（~0.001% VAF）</td>\n<td>极高（&gt;99.5%）</td>\n<td>个体化，低噪声</td>\n<td>需要组织样本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肿瘤不知情</td>\n<td>中（~0.1% VAF）</td>\n<td>高（&gt;95%）</td>\n<td>无需组织</td>\n<td>灵敏度受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键临床试验</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CIRCULATE-Japan / DYNAMIC</strong>：ctDNA 指导结直肠癌辅助化疗决策（ctDNA 阴性患者可安全省略化疗）</li>\n<li><strong>IMvigor010（膀胱癌）</strong>：ctDNA 阳性患者从辅助免疫治疗获益显著（HR = 0.58），阴性患者无获益</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"早期癌症筛查-多癌种早期检测-mced\">早期癌症筛查：多癌种早期检测（MCED）</h3><p>基于 cfDNA 甲基化信号的多癌种早期检测（Multi-Cancer Early Detection）是液体活检最雄心勃勃的应用方向。GRAIL 的 Galleri 检测利用甲基化测序和机器学习分类器，声称可在症状出现前检测超过 50 种癌症类型，并通过甲基化模式进行组织溯源。</p>\n<p><strong>MCED 面临的流行病学挑战</strong>：</p>\n<p>在低患病率人群中筛查时，即使特异度高达 99.5%，假阳性问题仍然严重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Se</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Prev</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Se</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Prev</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>Sp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>Prev</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PPV = \\frac{\\text{Se} \\times \\text{Prev}}{\\text{Se} \\times \\text{Prev} + (1 - \\text{Sp}) \\times (1 - \\text{Prev})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Se</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Prev</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sp</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Prev</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Se</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Prev</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Prev</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Prev} = 0.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Prev</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5%</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Se</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Se} = 50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Se</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Sp</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>99.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Sp} = 99.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sp</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.5%</span></span></span></span></span> 时：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.005</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.005</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.005</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.995</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>0.0025</mn><mrow><mn>0.0025</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.00498</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>33</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PPV = \\frac{0.5 \\times 0.005}{0.5 \\times 0.005 + 0.005 \\times 0.995} = \\frac{0.0025}{0.0025 + 0.00498} \\approx 33\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.005</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.005</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.995</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.005</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.0025</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.00498</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.0025</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着每 3 个筛查阳性者中仅有 1 人真正患癌，其余 2 人面临不必要的后续检查和心理负担。MCED 的临床效用需要通过大规模前瞻性 RCT（如 NHS-Galleri 试验，140,000 人）来验证是否降低癌症相关死亡率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"cfdna-片段组学\">cfDNA 片段组学</h3><p>cfDNA 片段组学（Fragmentomics）利用 cfDNA 的非突变特征——片段大小分布、末端序列偏好和核小体定位模式——推断肿瘤状态和组织来源。</p>\n<p>核心原理：肿瘤细胞的核小体定位与正常细胞不同（由表观遗传改变驱动），导致肿瘤来源 cfDNA 片段的大小分布和末端模式发生特征性变化。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>片段比例</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>短片段数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>150</mn><mtext> bp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>长片段数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>151</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>250</mn><mtext> bp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{片段比例} = \\frac{\\text{短片段数} (100\\text{-}150 \\text{ bp})}{\\text{长片段数} (151\\text{-}250 \\text{ bp})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">片段比例</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">长片段数</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">151</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">250</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> bp</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">短片段数</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> bp</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>肿瘤来源 cfDNA 倾向于产生更短的片段（~143 bp 单核小体峰值偏移），这一信号独立于突变信息，可作为正交验证维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一项 ctDNA 指导的结直肠癌 III 期辅助化疗决策试验：ctDNA 阴性患者随机化到观察 vs. 标准化疗。确定主要终点（DFS vs. OS）、非劣效性界值、ctDNA 检测时间点（术后几周）和样本量估算逻辑。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某 MCED 检测在 10,000 人筛查队列中报告了 120 个阳性结果，其中 30 人经确诊为真阳性。计算灵敏度（假设真实癌症患者为 50 人）、特异度、PPV 和 NPV，并讨论如何改进筛查策略以提高 PPV。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较肿瘤知情和肿瘤不知情 MRD 检测策略在以下临床场景中的选择：(a) 结直肠癌术后 MRD 监测，(b) 新辅助治疗后的病理完全缓解确认，(c) 多线治疗后的泛癌种监测。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>CHIP 突变在 70 岁以上人群中的检出率超过 10%。讨论 CHIP 对 ctDNA 检测的干扰机制，以及为什么单纯使用 VAF 阈值过滤不够，需要匹配白细胞基因组。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Wan et al. (2017)</strong>：<em>Liquid biopsies come of age: towards implementation of circulating tumour DNA</em>（Nature Reviews Cancer）— 液体活检领域的权威综述</li>\n<li><strong>Corcoran &amp; Chabner (2018)</strong>：<em>Application of cell-free DNA analysis to cancer treatment</em>（NEJM）— 临床应用导向的综述</li>\n<li><strong>Klein et al. (2021)</strong>：<em>Clinical validation of a targeted methylation-based multi-cancer early detection test</em>（Annals of Oncology）— Galleri 检测的验证数据</li>\n<li><strong>Cristiano et al. (2019)</strong>：<em>Genome-wide cell-free DNA fragmentation in patients with cancer</em>（Nature）— 片段组学的奠基研究</li>\n<li><strong>NHS-Galleri Trial</strong>（ClinicalTrials.gov）— 评估 MCED 临床效用的大规模 RCT</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>液体活检通过非侵入性分析血液中的肿瘤衍生分子，实现了肿瘤信息的动态获取。ctDNA 是临床最成熟的分析物，其应用从晚期肿瘤的伴随诊断扩展到术后 MRD 监测和多癌种早期筛查。肿瘤知情 MRD 策略在灵敏度上显著领先，而 cfDNA 甲基化和片段组学则提供了独立于突变信息的正交维度。MCED 的最终临床效用取决于大规模前瞻性 RCT 能否证明其降低癌症相关死亡率，而非仅仅提高检出率。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士转化医学 — 液体活检与循环肿瘤 DNA","id":"博士转化医学-液体活检与循环肿瘤-dna"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"ctDNA 检测技术","id":"ctdna-检测技术"},{"level":3,"text":"临床应用：MRD 监测","id":"临床应用-mrd-监测"},{"level":3,"text":"早期癌症筛查：多癌种早期检测（MCED）","id":"早期癌症筛查-多癌种早期检测-mced"},{"level":3,"text":"cfDNA 片段组学","id":"cfdna-片段组学"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士转化医学 — 多组学标志物发现管线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/biomarker-discovery/omics-biomarker-pipelines"},"next":{"title":"博士转化医学 — 影像生物标志物","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/biomarker-discovery/imaging-biomarkers"}}